sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant TM as Track Model
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    TM-->>H: return occupancy, switch positions, crossings, signal aspects (its STEP reply)
    Note right of TM: A failed block (broken rail, track circuit, power) is reported as occupied.
    H->>H: track_model_to_track_controller internal: keyed by block
    H->>M: step(dt, inputs.track_model)
    Note over H,M: step reaches SwTrackController through TrackControllerProcess.step and TrackControllerState.step (SD-09).
    M->>M: step internal: _readback := inputs.track_model, for _report (UC-17)
    loop each wayside (_apply)
        M->>W: set_occupancy(block, occupied), for each block
        W->>W: set_occupancy internal: occupancy[block], and trains[block] for display
        M->>W: set_switch_position(switch, reverse)
    end
    Note right of W: build_scan_inputs gives the PLC OCC_n and SWREV_s. FAIL_n is always 0.
